WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.269
-Now, Scarlett, you played
Black Widow for years,

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:05.404
so we thought we'd put your
Marvel knowledge to the test.

00:00:05.404 --> 00:00:08.107
It is time for the
"One-Second Marvel Quiz."

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:09.442
Here we go.

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:13.913
-♪ One, One-Second Marvel Quiz ♪

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:15.515
-Oh...no.

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.416
-Now, here's --
here's how it works.

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:19.252
We're going to play
a Marvel clip,

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:22.422
but it's going to be
just one second long.

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:24.724
And we're gonna take turns --
-What?!

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.393
-We're gonna take turns
guessing what the clip is from.

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:30.530
If we're wrong, the other person
gets a chance to steal.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.965
Scarlett, you're our guest,
so you'll go first.

00:00:32.965 --> 00:00:34.534
Let's see the first clip.

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:36.168
-Uh-oh.

00:00:36.168 --> 00:00:37.436
-There you go.

00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:38.805
-What? That was it?!

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:40.806
-Classic. Classic!

00:00:40.806 --> 00:00:42.675
-What --
I don't even know what I saw.

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:44.277
-Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.
Watch.

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.212
Watch again. Here we go.
Can we play it one more time?

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.480
-I can't --

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.349
I -- Huh?!

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:51.050
-I think I know what this is.
-That was so fast!

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.219
-I think this is --
'Cause everyone's
wearing their masks --

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.554
-Is it "Guardians"?

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:56.122
-This is from "Spider-Man."

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.557
[ Bell dings ]

00:00:57.557 --> 00:01:01.460
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:03.963
-Has Tom Holland played this?

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:06.032
Did he play that --
play this game?

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:07.900
-I'm just auditioning
'cause you never know when

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:09.702
they're gonna need another --

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:11.437
they're gonna need
another Spider-Man.

00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:14.406
I got the wrist thing going.
All right.

00:01:14.406 --> 00:01:17.176
It is my turn.
Let's see the next Marvel clip.

00:01:17.176 --> 00:01:19.512
-I got him!

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:21.080
-What?!
-No.

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:23.116
-You're supposed to know that?
-This is actually hard.

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:25.084
What is "I got him"? I don't --
That could be "Swingers."

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:26.952
I don't --
Maybe it's not even Marvel.

00:01:26.952 --> 00:01:29.122
Let me see it again. It's
Favreau. I know it's Favreau.

00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:30.723
So it's "Iron Man."
-I got him!

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:32.558
-I'm gonna say "Iron Man."

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:34.294
-[ Buzzer ]
-All right. There you go.

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:35.662
You -- You get to steal it.

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:37.330
-I think it's from "Iron Man 2."

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:38.531
[ Bell dings ]

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:40.232
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:40.232 --> 00:01:42.968
-Are you kidding me?!

00:01:42.968 --> 00:01:45.738
Are you joking, judges?!

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:48.341
Oh. "Iron Man 2"?
Stop it!

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:50.042
Oh, my gosh. All right.

00:01:50.042 --> 00:01:51.544
-I -- I had
the unfair advantage.

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:53.612
I was in that film.

00:01:53.612 --> 00:01:55.148
-Of course you were.

00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:58.717
You said, "You certainly did,"
after he said, "I got him!"

00:01:58.717 --> 00:02:01.820
-I responded to that line, yes,
the famous "I got him."

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:04.891
-Let's throw up the next clip.
This is your guess on this one.

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:07.927
-Excelsior.

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:11.564
-Oh, that's from
"Avengers 2: Age of Ultron."

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:12.698
[ Bell dings ]

00:02:12.698 --> 00:02:13.899
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:13.899 --> 00:02:16.136
Yes!

00:02:16.136 --> 00:02:18.338
-Whoa. Gosh. You are good.
All right.

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:20.406
-I was also in that,
so, again, unfair advantage.

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:21.874
-Yeah, oh, yeah.
Still, that was Stan Lee.

00:02:21.874 --> 00:02:23.809
I'm trying to remember --
This is tough for me.

00:02:23.809 --> 00:02:25.844
All right. I'm up.
Let's see the clip.

00:02:25.844 --> 00:02:27.346
This is for me.

00:02:27.346 --> 00:02:28.681
-I'm a trickster.

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:33.085
-That's Matt Damon doing Loki.

00:02:33.085 --> 00:02:36.722
It's in "Thor: Ragnarok."

00:02:36.722 --> 00:02:38.057
[ Bell dings ]

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:41.661
It's him playing -- Yeah.
It was very good.

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:43.663
I love -- That was very funny.
I knew that one.

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:45.297
All right. Here we go.
It's your turn.

00:02:45.297 --> 00:02:47.233
Let's run the next Marvel clip.

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:49.401
♪♪

00:02:49.401 --> 00:02:50.636
-Wait. What is the --
-Wait, wait.

00:02:50.636 --> 00:02:52.438
Does that say Blockbuster Video?
-Yeah.

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:54.306
-That's "Captain Marvel," right?

00:02:54.306 --> 00:02:55.641
[ Bell dings ]

00:02:55.641 --> 00:02:56.876
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:59.945
-That's good.

00:02:59.945 --> 00:03:02.047
That is good. I was not --

00:03:02.047 --> 00:03:04.316
I was going to say "Bill &amp; Ted's
Excellent Adventure."

00:03:04.316 --> 00:03:05.818
I had no idea.

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:08.220
-Can we just see,
what's the score here?

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:10.723
I have 3, and you have 2.
Oh, you're right behind me.

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:12.558
-Oh, yeah. Oh, I can come back.

00:03:12.558 --> 00:03:15.128
Oh, no problem. I got this one.

00:03:15.128 --> 00:03:16.729
Let's show my next clip.
-Okay.

00:03:16.729 --> 00:03:17.863
-And I'll just guess it
right now. Here we go.

00:03:17.863 --> 00:03:19.766
-Gross.

00:03:19.766 --> 00:03:21.333
-I got this.
It's "Howard the Duck."

00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:23.002
-Does this make it easier?

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:24.436
-That is "Howard the Duck"

00:03:24.436 --> 00:03:26.239
because Howard the Duck
is a Marvel character.

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:29.342
I know that. It was -- I think
it was a George Lucas movie

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:31.144
at one point, "Howard the Duck."

00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:33.980
It did not work,
but it is in the Marvel thing,

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.182
and so they threw it
in the end of --

00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:38.718
either "Guardians
of the Galaxy" 1 or 2.

00:03:38.718 --> 00:03:40.219
[ Bell dings ]

00:03:40.219 --> 00:03:42.121
-One?
-There you go!

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:44.156
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:44.156 --> 00:03:45.357
-Just take it.

00:03:45.357 --> 00:03:47.360
Just take it and walk away
from the vehicle.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:50.129
They said yes.
-It felt --

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:53.333
It felt to me like you may
have said two movies there.

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:55.267
-It's all right.
It doesn't matter what I said.

00:03:55.267 --> 00:03:57.803
The judges gave a ding,
and once they give the ding,

00:03:57.803 --> 00:03:59.839
you're allowed to sing.
You know what I'm saying?

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:02.675
That's the -- Now, here we go.
This is the final round.

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:05.978
Okay? And this one
is worth 1,000 points.

00:04:05.978 --> 00:04:10.917
Whichever one of us shouts out
the correct answer first wins.

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:14.086
-Wha--

00:04:14.086 --> 00:04:17.623
-Ready?
Let's play the clip. Go.

00:04:17.623 --> 00:04:18.991
-Mother...

00:04:18.991 --> 00:04:20.993
-Uh, uh, "Avengers" something.

00:04:20.993 --> 00:04:22.195
-Oh, oh! Wait, wait!

00:04:22.195 --> 00:04:24.130
"Infinity War"!
"Infinity War"!

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:25.331
[ Bell dings ]

00:04:25.331 --> 00:04:27.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:29.168 --> 00:04:30.836
-How do you know that?
"Infinity..."

00:04:30.836 --> 00:04:33.506
Scarlett Johansson.
I was gonna say "Endgame."

00:04:33.506 --> 00:04:35.074
You did it!

00:04:35.074 --> 00:04:38.544
Sorry to put you on the spot.
Sorry to put you on the spot.

00:04:38.544 --> 00:04:42.081
Her new movie, "Black Widow,"
is coming to theaters July 9th.

00:04:42.081 --> 00:04:43.750
That's what I'm talking about.

